# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# DENY BY DEFAULT.
#
# This working tree is a 34 GB document library containing copyrighted
# books and personal scanned mail. Nothing is committed unless it is
# explicitly un-ignored below, so an accidental `git add -A` cannot
# publish anything.
#
# The audit corpus is added deliberately with `git add -f` by
# audit/select_corpus.py, which enforces the eligibility rules
# (PDF <= 1 MB, no Z-Library books, no scan_* folders).
# ------------------------------------------------------------------

# ignore everything at the root
/*

# ...except the harness and its outputs
!/.gitignore
!/.gitattributes
!/README.md
!/CLAUDE.md
!/LICENSE
!/audit/
!/.github/
!/.claude/
!/reports/

# never commit these, wherever they appear
*.docmodel.json
*.docpack.json
chars.json
*.lines.json
*.tgz
*.zip
**/rasterize/
**/inspect/
**/visionocr/
**/viewer/
**/images_extracted/
**/okf/
**/latex/
*.inspect.html
*.spoken.tiddlers.json

# audit state: the rolling state file is large and machine-only.
# Reports and history ARE committed - they are the day-over-day record.
/reports/state.json
/reports/nightly.log
/reports/soak.jsonl
/reports/soak-run.log

# local noise
.codegraph/
.env
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store
